{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to schedule a focused planning session or ask about our bespoke integrative offerings in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#00695c;--muted:#6b7280;--bg:#fbfbfd;--card:#ffffff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial;color:#0f172a;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7fafc 0%, #fbfbfd 100%);}
    .wrap{max-width:1000px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(13,27,39,0.06);background:var(--card);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700;font-size:20px}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    h1{margin:6px 0 0 0;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 18px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:20px}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),var(--glass));padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.03)}

    /* Timeline planner */
    .timeline{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .phase{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(6,95,70,0.06)}
    .phase .meta{flex:1}
    .phase h3{margin:0;font-size:16px}
    .phase p{margin:6px 0 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .controls{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}
    input[type=range]{width:160px}
    .summary{margin-top:12px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8fafc;font-size:14px;color:#0b1220}
    .disclaimer{font-size:12px;color:#7b8794;margin-top:10px}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .proof{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .testimonial{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#f7fcfb);border:1px solid rgba(1,52,45,0.04);min-height:84px}
    .t-body{font-size:14px;color:#072023}
    .t-author{margin-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:#023c34}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .badge{background:#e6fffa;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#064e45;border:1px solid rgba(3,72,60,0.06);position:relative}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;top:-36px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#083;color:#fff;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;display:none}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{display:block}
    .controls-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(6,95,70,0.12);color:var(--accent)}

    /* form */
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input,textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(12,23,31,0.06);font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    footer{margin-top:14px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* subtle pattern using background SVG */
    .pattern{position:absolute;right:-120px;top:-80px;opacity:0.06;width:420px;height:420px;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-size:contain;background-repeat:no-repeat;transform:rotate(18deg)}

    @media(max-width:920px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pattern{display:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">HM</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="index.html">Start</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Concerns</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Path</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="about.html">Team</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html" style="color:var(--accent)">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="grid">
      <section>
        <h1>Connect & Plan a fast-track visit</h1>
        <p class="lead">Use this page to ask a question, request a VIP planning day, or sketch a three-phase timeline that fits into your life. We meet you where you are — practical, cautious, and respectful of clinical context.</p>

        <div class="card timeline" id="timelinePlanner" aria-labelledby="plannerHeading">
          <h2 id="plannerHeading" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:16px">Timeline planner — build a short roadmap</h2>

          <div class="phase" data-phase="1">
            <div class="meta">
              <h3>Phase 1 — Stabilize</h3>
              <p>Rapid assessment, priorities for safety, and immediate habit shifts. Typical focus: baseline measures and predictable supports.</p>
              <div class="controls">
                <label for="p1Weeks">Weeks</label>
                <input id="p1Weeks" type="range" min="1" max="6" value="2">
                <div id="p1Val">2 wk</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="width:120px;text-align:center">
              <strong id="p1Check">Check-in: week 2</strong>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="phase" data-phase="2">
            <div class="meta">
              <h3>Phase 2 — Establish</h3>
              <p>Build routines, refine supports, introduce tailored skills. Typical focus: consistent daily practices and measurable progress.</p>
              <div class="controls">
                <label for="p2Weeks">Weeks</label>
                <input id="p2Weeks" type="range" min="2" max="12" value="6">
                <div id="p2Val">6 wk</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="width:120px;text-align:center">
              <strong id="p2Check">Check-in: week 6</strong>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="phase" data-phase="3">
            <div class="meta">
              <h3>Phase 3 — Integrate</h3>
              <p>Move practices into daily life, consolidate gains, and prepare a maintenance plan. Typical focus: autonomy and relapse planning.</p>
              <div class="controls">
                <label for="p3Weeks">Weeks</label>
                <input id="p3Weeks" type="range" min="4" max="24" value="12">
                <div id="p3Val">12 wk</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="width:120px;text-align:center">
              <strong id="p3Check">Check-in: week 12</strong>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="summary" id="planSummary">
            Plan length: 20 weeks • Suggested check-ins: weeks 2, 6, 12
          </div>

          <div class="disclaimer">Educational planning tool only. This is not personalized medical advice. Timelines are illustrative and will be adjusted in clinical conversation. No promises of outcomes are made.</div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px">
            <button class="btn" id="savePlan">Save snapshot</button>
            <button class="ghost" id="resetPlan">Reset</button>
            <div style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Want a guided session? <a href="book.html">Reserve a VIP Day</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>

        <div class="card proof">
          <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:16px">Proof gallery — voices & credibility</h2>
          <p style="margin:6px 0 12px 0;color:var(--muted)">Rotating perspectives from clients and badges that explain our external recognitions.</p>

          <div class="testimonial" id="testimonialArea">
            <div class="t-body" id="tBody">"I appreciated the practical pacing and the focus on measurable steps. The planning session helped me set realistic goals."</div>
            <div class="t-author" id="tAuthor">— A client in {{CITY}}</div>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:10px">
            <div class="badges" id="badges">
              <div class="badge">Board-aligned
                <div class="tooltip">Clinician team includes board-eligible practitioners.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="badge">Privacy-first
                <div class="tooltip">HIPAA-aware processes and secure intake.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="badge">Peer-reviewed mentions
                <div class="tooltip">Featured in professional roundtables and case reviews.</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="controls-row">
              <button class="ghost" id="prevT">Prev</button>
              <button class="ghost" id="nextT">Next</button>
              <button class="btn" id="shareC">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="disclaimer" style="margin-top:10px">Testimonials reflect individual experiences and do not guarantee similar outcomes. Credibility badges summarize affiliations and public recognitions; verify details during intake.</div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Quick contact</h3>
          <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;color:var(--muted)">Prefer email or phone? Reach us directly or use the form below to request availability.</p>

          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px">
            <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a><br>
            <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>
          </div>

          <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="return false">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="First and last" required>

            <label for="method">Preferred contact</label>
            <select id="method" name="method">
              <option>Email</option>
              <option>Phone</option>
              <option>Message</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Brief: reason for contact, best times, and any urgent notes"></textarea>

            <label style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)"><input type="checkbox" id="consent"> I understand this form is for scheduling and intake questions only — not urgent medical care.</label>

            <button class="btn" id="sendBtn">Send request</button>
          </form>

          <footer>
            We are licensed to provide consultative care in {{STATE}}. For urgent medical needs, please contact emergency services or your primary care provider.
          </footer>
        </div>

        <div style="height:16px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Quick links</h4>
          <nav aria-label="Secondary" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <a href="about.html">Who we are</a>
            <a href="services.html">Services & models</a>
            <a href="pricing.html">Pricing overview</a>
            <a href="book.html">Reserve a VIP Day</a>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

  </div>

  <script>
    // Timeline planner logic
    function updateSummary(){
      const p1 = +document.getElementById('p1Weeks').value;
      const p2 = +document.getElementById('p2Weeks').value;
      const p3 = +document.getElementById('p3Weeks').value;
      const total = p1 + p2 + p3;
      document.getElementById('p1Val').textContent = p1 + ' wk';
      document.getElementById('p2Val').textContent = p2 + ' wk';
      document.getElementById('p3Val').textContent = p3 + ' wk';
      document.getElementById('p1Check').textContent = 'Check-in: week ' + p1;
      document.getElementById('p2Check').textContent = 'Check-in: week ' + (p1 + p2);
      document.getElementById('p3Check').textContent = 'Check-in: week ' + (p1 + p2 + Math.ceil(p3/2));
      document.getElementById('planSummary').textContent = 'Plan length: ' + total + ' weeks • Suggested check-ins: weeks ' + p1 + ', ' + (p1 + p2) + ', ' + (p1 + p2 + Math.ceil(p3/2));
    }
    ['p1Weeks','p2Weeks','p3Weeks'].forEach(id=>document.getElementById(id).addEventListener('input', updateSummary));
    document.getElementById('resetPlan').addEventListener('click', ()=>{document.getElementById('p1Weeks').value=2;document.getElementById('p2Weeks').value=6;document.getElementById('p3Weeks').value=12;updateSummary();});
    document.getElementById('savePlan').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const snapshot = document.getElementById('planSummary').textContent;
      navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(snapshot).then(()=>alert('Snapshot copied to clipboard'));
    });
    updateSummary();

    // Proof gallery: rotating testimonials
    const testimonials = [
      {body:'"I appreciated the practical pacing and the attention to measurable steps. The planning session clarified next actions."', author:'— A client in {{CITY}}'},
      {body:'"Focused, thoughtful guidance. The clinician helped me prioritize what mattered and plan follow-ups."', author:'— Healthcare colleague'},
      {body:'"Respectful, evidence-minded approach. I valued the clear expectations and the structured check-ins."', author:'— Participant in a short program'}
    ];
    let tIndex = 0;
    const tBody = document.getElementById('tBody');
    const tAuthor = document.getElementById('tAuthor');
    function showTest(i){
      const t = testimonials[i];
      tBody.textContent = t.body;
      tAuthor.textContent = t.author;
    }
    document.getElementById('nextT').addEventListener('click', ()=>{tIndex=(tIndex+1)%testimonials.length;showTest(tIndex);});
    document.getElementById('prevT').addEventListener('click', ()=>{tIndex=(tIndex-1+testimonials.length)%testimonials.length;showTest(tIndex);});
    // auto-rotate
    setInterval(()=>{tIndex=(tIndex+1)%testimonials.length;showTest(tIndex);},6000);

    // Contact form simple handler
    document.getElementById('sendBtn').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const msg = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
      const consent = document.getElementById('consent').checked;
      if(!name){alert('Please enter your name');return}
      if(!consent){alert('Please confirm the acknowledgment');return}
      // Simulate send: open mailto as fallback
      const subject = encodeURIComponent('Inquiry from ' + name);
      const body = encodeURIComponent(msg + '\n\nPreferred contact: ' + document.getElementById('method').value);
      window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + body;
    });

    // CTA: primary
    document.getElementById('shareC').addEventListener('click', ()=>{window.location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';});
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This chunk contains two files for the holistic_medicine site (slug: holistic_medicine-MORE-2026-02-17T18-29-14-227Z-009).

Files included:

- contact.html
  - Purpose: Contact and intake page with two interactive features built in plain HTML/CSS/JS.
  - Features implemented:
    - Timeline planner: three phases (Stabilize, Establish, Integrate). Users can adjust weeks per phase via range inputs; the UI summarizes total plan length and suggested check-ins. A snapshot button copies the summary to clipboard. Clear disclaimer: educational tool only, not medical advice.
    - Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials and credibility badges. Testimonials auto-rotate and have manual Prev/Next controls. Badges show brief tooltips on hover. Testimonials include the {{CITY}} placeholder.
    - Contact form: local handling that validates name and consent, then opens an email draft to {{EMAIL}}. Includes phone and email placeholders: {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}.
    - Navigation uses an alternate label set: Start, Offerings, Concerns, Path, Rates, Team, Reserve, Connect.
    - CTA button wired to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} and labeled with {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}.
  - Accessibility: labels and ARIA where appropriate; tooltips are simple and visible on hover.
  - Legal: explicit disclaimers for planning tool and testimonials; encourages urgent care via emergency services.

- README.md (this file)
  - Explains contents and usage notes.

Placeholders present in contact.html (do not replace here — intended for template processing):
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
  - {{TAGLINE}}
  - {{PHONE}}
  - {{EMAIL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
  - {{CITY}}
  - {{STATE}}

Notes for developers/designers:
  - The page references assets/img/pattern.svg for a subtle background motif. Ensure the project includes a unique SVG at that path.
  - No external fonts or CDNs used; keep assets local.
  - Copy is intentionally cautious and educational in tone; avoid making cure or outcome guarantees.
  - The timeline planner is a lightweight client-side tool intended for planning discussions; keep server-side validation and formal intake separate.

If you need a separate JS module or additional analytics, extract inline scripts into a local file and load it from the bundle root.
"} 
BUNDLE_END
